1167
01:11:42,083 --> 01:11:44,208
<i>Coba pikirkan, Volodya.</i>

1168
01:11:44,375 --> 01:11:46,500
<i>Kalau kau pergi menghibur istri-istri pelaut itu,</i>

1169
01:11:46,667 --> 01:11:48,625
