1217
01:14:34,333 --> 01:14:38,083
MARKAS PBB, NEW YORK

1218
01:14:38,250 --> 01:14:41,292
<i>Dengan hati-hati, Berezovsky memilih pengasingan di London.</i>

1219
01:14:41,458 --> 01:14:44,417
